+that inclusion and complement.
+
+The conormal lift C{[}S{]}/(χ²) used to compute (23) maps surjectively
+to the actual contracted level C{[}S{]}/(χ\_2), because
+(χ²)⊆I²∩C{[}S{]}=(χ\_2). No equality of these ideals is asserted. This
