+Its support observation is \(b_R(\tau)=0\) and \(b_R(a^\bullet)=1\). The pair \((p_R,b_R)\) retains the whole scalar. For every ring map \(f\), its split lift fixes \(\tau\) and sends \(a^\bullet\) to \(f(a)^\bullet\). In particular
+
+$$
+\begin{array}{ccc}
